-song:p051","quote":"平公三年，楚共王拔宋之彭城，以封宋左師魚石。四年，諸矦共誅魚石，而歸彭城於宋。三十五年，楚公子圍弒其君自立，爲靈王。四十四年，平公卒，子元公佐立。"}],"rationale":"按本篇明示名與稱號、宋國世系及具體事件暫同指；未把同字短名全域合併，所有引句與未定處保留。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"},{"id":"d-shiji039-086","person_id":"cbr-p001032","surfaces":["共王","楚共王","王"],"scope":"cross_chapter","chapter_ids":["c-shiji-031-wu","c-shiji-039-jin"],"status":"contextual_provisional","evidence":[{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p005","quote":"王壽夢二年，楚之亡大夫申公巫臣怨楚將子反而犇晉，自晉使吳，教吳用兵乘車，令其子爲吳行人，吳於是始通於中國。吳伐楚。十六年，楚共王伐吳，至衡山。"},{"paragraph_id":"c-shiji-039-jin:p111","quote":"六年春，鄭倍晉與楚盟，晉怒。欒書曰：「不可以當吾世而失諸侯。」乃發兵。厲公自將，五月度河。聞楚兵來救，范文子請公欲還。郤至曰：「發兵誅逆，見彊辟之，無以令諸侯。」遂與戰。癸巳，射中楚共王目，楚兵敗於鄢陵。子反收餘兵，拊循欲復戰，晉患之。共王召子反，其侍者豎陽穀進酒，子反醉，不能見。王怒，讓子反，子反死。王遂引兵歸。晉由此威諸侯，欲以令天下求霸。"}],"rationale":"按本篇明示名與稱號、晉世系與具體事件暫定所列提及同指；附各段原文，未按同字短名全域合併；紀年與版本差異待核。","reviewer":"Codex（AI 代理）"}],"equivalence_decisions":[],"passages":[{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:p005","text":"王壽夢二年，楚之亡大夫申公巫臣怨楚將子反而犇晉，自晉使吳，教吳用兵乘車，令其子爲吳行人，吳於是始通於中國。吳伐楚。十六年，楚共王伐吳，至衡山。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m005-0000","start":0,"end":3,"surface":"王壽夢","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001029","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m005-0011","start":11,"end":15,"surface":"申公巫臣","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001030","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m005-0018","start":18,"end":20,"surface":"子反","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001031","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m005-0037","start":37,"end":39,"surface":"其子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"匿名者、族稱或未定指代，未補姓名與成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-031-wu:m005-0061","start":61,"end":64,"surface":"楚共王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001032","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-031-wu","book_id":"b-shiji-031","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-031-wu"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:p018","text":"二十八年，楚莊王卒。二十九年，陳倍楚盟。三十年，楚共王伐陳。是歲，成公卒，子哀公弱立。楚以陳喪，罷兵去。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m018-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"楚莊王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000257","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m018-0024","start":24,"end":27,"surface":"楚共王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001032","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m018-0033","start":33,"end":35,"surface":"成公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001490","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi:m018-0038","start":38,"end":41,"surface":"哀公弱","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001403","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-036-chenqi","book_id":"b-shiji-036","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-036-chenqi"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:p051","text":"平公三年，楚共王拔宋之彭城，以封宋左師魚石。四年，諸矦共誅魚石，而歸彭城於宋。三十五年，楚公子圍弒其君自立，爲靈王。四十四年，平公卒，子元公佐立。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m051-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"平公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001668","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m051-0005","start":5,"end":8,"surface":"楚共王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001032","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m051-0016","start":16,"end":21,"surface":"宋左師魚石","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001665","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m051-0029","start":29,"end":31,"surface":"魚石","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p001665","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m051-0044","start":44,"end":48,"surface":"楚公子圍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000417","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m051-0055","start":55,"end":57,"surface":"靈王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p000417","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-038-song:m051-0063","start":63,"end":65,"surface":"平公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p